//   - inHigh: High price of each bar.
//   - inLow: Low price of each bar.
//   - inClose: Close price of each bar.
//
// Outputs, each at least as long as the values written (the input length always
// suffices):
//   - outInteger: +100 or -100 on a hit, 0 otherwise. Sign = candlecolor of the
//     candle with the larger realbody (i if realbody(i) > realbody(i-1), else
//     i-1; tie goes to i-1): +100 if that marubozu is white, -100 if black.
//
// Element k of each output is the value at bar BegIdx+k of the returned
// [OutRange], and BegIdx is at least [Core.CDLKICKINGBYLENGTHLookback]: a range
// that ends before it returns NBElement 0.
